WEBVTT

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.600 --> 00:46.786
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.600 --> 00:46.787
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.020 --> 00:56.153
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.020 --> 00:56.154
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.769 --> 01:14.817
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.776 --> 01:14.817
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.812 --> 01:30.732
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.651 --> 01:33.986
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.862 --> 01:35.905
Black Jack.

01:47.595 --> 01:50.144
Good morning, everyone.

01:50.525 --> 01:53.593
Let's have another good, fun day.

01:54.104 --> 01:55.612
Now, today's top news!

01:56.740 --> 01:57.906
Hey, it's Rei-chan's program.

01:58.158 --> 02:00.826
Our idol, Asato Rei, right?

02:00.827 --> 02:02.870
I'm a huge fan of hers.

02:02.871 --> 02:03.704
Me too!

02:04.497 --> 02:07.974
Next, it's the fun news for the morning.

02:10.443 --> 02:13.580
Originally by Tezuka Osamu "Scream"

02:10.443 --> 02:13.580
The Idol Who Lost Her Voice

02:17.597 --> 02:18.344
Wait!

02:22.640 --> 02:23.766
10 points!

02:23.767 --> 02:26.226
Wato, you're cutting it close again.

02:26.227 --> 02:27.269
Sorry, sir.

02:27.568 --> 02:28.632
I'm sorry!

02:33.485 --> 02:35.027
Hey, Wato-san!

02:35.028 --> 02:36.820
Eating in the hallway is against the rules.

02:37.572 --> 02:39.573
I missed my breakfast.

02:39.574 --> 02:43.077
For being the captain of the kendo
club, you sure are a slacker.

02:43.078 --> 02:44.745
This is not related...

02:44.746 --> 02:47.998
Anyway, please follow the rules from now on.

02:49.834 --> 02:52.753
Yeah, yeah, I understand, Miss Student President.

02:54.255 --> 02:57.966
Hey, hey, is it true that you were
recruited by the talent office?

02:58.885 --> 03:00.469
Are you going to be an idol?

03:00.470 --> 03:02.638
I don't know yet.

03:02.639 --> 03:04.306
But you're so good!

03:04.307 --> 03:05.891
On top of being the student president,

03:05.892 --> 03:08.435
you work hard for the broadcast and choir clubs!

03:08.436 --> 03:09.228
Now you'll be a celeb!

03:09.229 --> 03:10.312
I envy you!

03:10.313 --> 03:11.855
I want to become like you!

03:11.856 --> 03:13.607
Don't flatter me so much.

03:16.361 --> 03:17.986
Are you okay, Rei-chan?

03:17.987 --> 03:20.614
Yeah... it's nothing serious.

03:27.247 --> 03:29.331
All rght, let's start the lesson!

03:29.791 --> 03:31.208
Kendo club, come here!

03:41.511 --> 03:43.387
What is this?

03:43.388 --> 03:47.182
Captain, we were informed that the choir club
would be practicing here, remember?

03:47.183 --> 03:47.933
We were?

03:50.979 --> 03:53.772
Asato-san's voice is so nice.

03:53.773 --> 03:57.985
I heard that her recruitment will be
finalized if they win the choir competition.

03:58.695 --> 03:59.570
That's cool!

04:11.916 --> 04:14.042
Hey there! What're you doing?!

04:17.505 --> 04:19.031
Over here!

04:19.132 --> 04:21.091
Jeez!

04:22.760 --> 04:24.386
Hey, Asato-san!

04:24.888 --> 04:28.056
The kendo club can't practice like this!

04:28.850 --> 04:33.020
We informed you of our rehearsals
being here the other day.

04:33.021 --> 04:34.771
But what about all these people?

04:35.273 --> 04:37.691
The gym is not only for athletes!

04:37.757 --> 04:38.211
That's right!

04:38.244 --> 04:39.182
Get lost, Wato!

04:39.402 --> 04:43.488
The weak kendo club is jealous of the popular choir club?

04:43.990 --> 04:44.906
What?!

04:46.075 --> 04:47.075
Please stop!
Let me go!

04:47.076 --> 04:48.243
You're embarrassing us!

04:48.244 --> 04:48.660
Let me go!

04:48.700 --> 04:50.579
Please stop!

04:50.872 --> 04:54.082
I know it will be a great bother for the kendo club,

04:54.083 --> 04:57.544
but please cooperate with us until
our competition in three months.

04:57.545 --> 05:02.633
Also, dear fans, please do not disrupt other club activities.

05:05.928 --> 05:06.928
Let's go.

05:07.515 --> 05:08.889
That's no fun.

05:11.059 --> 05:14.061
How do you like that, Captain Wato?

05:23.821 --> 05:25.425
She's so annoying!

05:25.573 --> 05:28.325
She's being so cocky, as if she can do anything!

05:28.326 --> 05:29.493
She pisses me off!

05:29.494 --> 05:30.494
Really?

05:31.079 --> 05:33.246
She's a kind, nice girl.

05:33.247 --> 05:35.374
Maybe she can be friends with you.

05:35.375 --> 05:37.281
Huh? With me?

05:37.710 --> 05:38.418
No.

05:38.419 --> 05:39.920
That's impossible.

05:39.921 --> 05:41.546
Kumiko!

05:46.928 --> 05:48.887
Good, I caught up.

05:48.888 --> 05:50.055
What's the matter, Rei-chan?

05:50.056 --> 05:51.890
I wanted to talk with you.

05:52.892 --> 05:54.893
Oh, so I'm bothering you.

05:55.395 --> 05:56.561
I'm going home now.

05:56.562 --> 05:57.562
Take your time!

05:57.563 --> 05:58.230
Wato-san!

06:01.109 --> 06:02.234
Wato-san...

06:09.992 --> 06:11.493
So, what's this all about?

06:12.995 --> 06:16.331
Your father is a well-known doctor, isn't he?

06:17.291 --> 06:20.085
I thought his name was Honma Joutarou.

06:20.086 --> 06:20.794
Yeah.

06:25.133 --> 06:27.384
But he's not around anymore.

06:27.385 --> 06:29.094
He passed away three years ago.

06:29.428 --> 06:30.595
I see.

06:30.596 --> 06:31.346
I'm sorry.

06:31.347 --> 06:32.430
Oh, don't worry about it.

06:33.015 --> 06:35.058
But why do you ask?

06:37.895 --> 06:38.854
Rei-chan?

06:42.567 --> 06:43.942
What's the matter, Rei-chan?

06:46.112 --> 06:46.653
My voice...

06:47.530 --> 06:48.697
My voice...

06:49.323 --> 06:52.242
My voice is disappearing!

06:54.370 --> 06:55.203
Rei-chan!

06:59.292 --> 07:02.126
Ever since about four months ago, there
has been some irritation in my throat.

07:02.628 --> 07:05.380
Just recently, it became more and
more painful to use my voice.

07:05.381 --> 07:07.257
Did you go see a doctor?

07:07.258 --> 07:08.174
Yes.

07:08.175 --> 07:11.344
But they said there's a possibility
that I may lose my original voice.

07:11.637 --> 07:12.688
No way...

07:12.805 --> 07:15.265
If I lose my voice...

07:15.850 --> 07:18.018
Your case is a vocal chord polyp.

07:18.019 --> 07:21.980
It-s situated in a slightly complicated place,
but there's nothing to worry about.

07:21.981 --> 07:23.815
So it can be cured?

07:23.816 --> 07:25.483
No, I didn't say that.

07:26.777 --> 07:31.448
I'm saying that it's nothing dangerous,
as long as you don't abuse your voice.

07:31.449 --> 07:32.908
You'll just have some huskiness in your voice.

07:32.909 --> 07:33.825
No way!

07:34.368 --> 07:38.288
If I can't have my original voice, I'd rather die!

07:38.789 --> 07:40.916
You'd rather die?

07:41.459 --> 07:43.560
Then I have to operate on you.

07:43.753 --> 07:45.754
It's difficult, but I must cut it off.

07:46.005 --> 07:48.090
You're going to cut my throat?

07:48.299 --> 07:49.299
Are you scared?

07:49.884 --> 07:50.889
I'm not...

07:51.135 --> 07:53.094
Rei-chan, it'll be fine.

07:53.095 --> 07:55.680
Doctor will have it taken out just fine, I'm sure.

07:56.724 --> 07:58.475
100,000,000 yen!

07:58.517 --> 08:01.186
It will cost you 100,000,000 yen!

08:01.520 --> 08:04.397
My Doc's operation fee is expensive!

08:04.398 --> 08:06.171
Especially for girls!

08:06.525 --> 08:07.984
Pinoco, that's too high.

08:08.402 --> 08:11.308
Anyway, there is just one condition
for me to operate on you.

08:11.572 --> 08:14.699
You must obey my instructions no matter what.

08:15.743 --> 08:16.785
Will you?

08:18.204 --> 08:19.412
Yes.

08:19.830 --> 08:20.955
Please do it.

08:25.670 --> 08:28.838
Kumiko, don't tell anyone about my throat.

08:28.839 --> 08:29.464
Why?

08:30.341 --> 08:31.424
I'm scared.

08:31.425 --> 08:36.356
I tried harder than other people to be where I am now.

08:36.555 --> 08:39.432
The broadcast club, the choir,
and the student government...

08:39.809 --> 08:41.976
I'm scared of all those things breaking away.

08:43.688 --> 08:44.604
Rei-chan...

08:44.605 --> 08:48.900
Besides, if they find out, then I can't
attend the choir competition.

08:48.901 --> 08:50.402
So, Kumiko, please!

08:50.778 --> 08:53.405
It's a secret between you and me.

08:53.781 --> 08:55.365
Yeah.

08:55.991 --> 08:57.075
Promise?

08:58.119 --> 08:59.035
I understand.

09:06.001 --> 09:07.794
Pinoco, why are you growling?

09:08.212 --> 09:09.490
You look unhappy.

09:09.672 --> 09:13.383
You're always gentle with girls!

09:13.384 --> 09:14.467
Don't joke about that.

09:14.468 --> 09:16.201
I don't discriminate men from women
when it comes to patients.

09:16.679 --> 09:17.512
Let's begin.

09:23.060 --> 09:34.737
I love you, darling, please love me more and more

09:23.060 --> 09:34.737
Daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo ai shite

09:39.368 --> 09:40.577
<i>Voice...</i>

09:40.578 --> 09:42.954
<i>Where did my voice go?</i>

09:50.004 --> 09:51.546
The operation was a success.

09:52.089 --> 09:54.007
The polyp has been successfully removed.

09:57.192 --> 10:00.405
When will I be released?

09:58.596 --> 10:00.180
You can be out of here in two or three days.

10:00.806 --> 10:03.474
But refrain from using your voice for two weeks.

10:03.893 --> 10:05.348
Two weeks?

10:05.686 --> 10:10.073
At home and at school, you absolutely must
not use your voice for the next two weeks.

10:10.316 --> 10:12.859
Then you will have your voice back.

10:12.860 --> 10:14.485
That's great, Rei-chan!

10:18.977 --> 10:22.124
I will endure for two weeks.

10:20.159 --> 10:21.242
It's a promise.

10:25.789 --> 10:26.581
Rei-chan!

10:26.582 --> 10:28.166
We were worried about you.

10:28.500 --> 10:30.450
Are you okay now?

10:30.586 --> 10:33.129
You'll let us hear your wonderful voice again, right?

10:33.547 --> 10:35.215
I'm glad for you, Asato-san.

10:35.216 --> 10:36.090
Yeah.

10:36.383 --> 10:38.140
You can't use your voice yet?

10:38.173 --> 10:39.928
I hope you'll get better soon.

10:41.805 --> 10:43.848
Asato-san is back.

10:43.849 --> 10:44.724
Y-yes.

10:44.850 --> 10:47.048
Kumiko, aren't you hiding something from me?

10:47.269 --> 10:49.181
I-I'm not hiding...

10:49.396 --> 10:50.647
What?

10:50.648 --> 10:52.690
You don't hang out with me, either.

10:52.691 --> 10:54.734
You're thinking too much!

10:54.735 --> 10:58.321
Then let's get a parfait at Tom's after school today.

10:58.322 --> 10:59.656
I'll pay for it.

11:00.324 --> 11:02.968
You being flustered makes it even more suspicious.

11:03.202 --> 11:04.035
Oh well.

11:10.706 --> 11:13.332
Oh, Rei-chan isn't singing.

11:13.333 --> 11:15.167
She's not feeling her best yet.

11:15.168 --> 11:16.794
But can't she sing just a bit?

11:17.379 --> 11:18.504
Sing for us!

11:18.505 --> 11:20.256
Rei-chan! Let us hear your voice!

11:20.257 --> 11:21.133
Rei-chan!

11:20.632 --> 11:21.799
Please, Rei-chan!

11:22.152 --> 11:23.457
Rei-chan!

11:24.017 --> 11:25.357
Rei-chan!

11:25.857 --> 11:27.224
Rei-chan!

11:27.650 --> 11:29.123
Rei-chan!

11:29.497 --> 11:30.690
Rei-chan!

11:30.309 --> 11:31.350
Stop it, everyone!

11:31.351 --> 11:32.310
Rei-chan is...

11:31.383 --> 11:32.730
Rei-chan!

11:33.118 --> 11:34.451
Rei-chan!

11:33.979 --> 11:38.399
Well, Asato-san, would you join the
practice even for just a little while?

11:40.819 --> 11:43.696
You absolutely must not use your
voice for the next two weeks.

11:43.697 --> 11:44.822
Promise me.

11:46.283 --> 11:47.440
<i>Maybe...</i>

11:47.868 --> 11:49.201
<i>Maybe a little...</i>

11:54.708 --> 11:55.708
<i>Rei-chan...</i>

12:02.966 --> 12:04.800
<i>My voice...</i>

12:34.831 --> 12:35.790
Rei-chan!

12:42.209 --> 12:43.084
Rei-chan!

12:44.920 --> 12:46.463
What's wrong, all of a sudden?

12:49.175 --> 12:50.008
Rei-chan?

12:55.431 --> 12:56.306
Rei-chan!

12:57.224 --> 12:59.342
Hang on, Rei-chan!

13:08.499 --> 13:09.874
How could you do this?!

13:10.084 --> 13:12.287
The vocal chords are swollen and infected.

13:12.628 --> 13:13.791
It's vocal chord paralysis!

13:14.004 --> 13:16.672
Your toad-like voice will never be cured.

13:17.549 --> 13:19.550
Doctor, isn't there any way?

13:20.969 --> 13:22.553
Do you really want your voice back?

13:27.518 --> 13:29.008
This is an artificial vocal chord.

13:29.728 --> 13:32.688
If we put this in your throat, you can have your voice back.

13:33.273 --> 13:35.688
However, this operation is extremely difficult.

13:36.026 --> 13:37.786
I'm perhaps the only one who can
successfully operate on you.

13:38.070 --> 13:38.945
It will cost you, too.

13:41.573 --> 13:42.573
Will you take it seriously?

13:43.617 --> 13:47.912
Then don't use your voice no matter
what for the next three months.

13:48.455 --> 13:52.458
If you can keep that promise, then I will
consider performing this operation.

13:54.878 --> 13:56.512
Promise me this time.

13:56.839 --> 13:57.505
Got that?

14:00.551 --> 14:02.969
I'm sorry, sir, I'm late.

14:03.929 --> 14:04.877
Wato-san...

14:05.097 --> 14:07.598
Why are you so late?

14:08.308 --> 14:09.228
Um...

14:09.434 --> 14:11.644
I'm sorry I stood you up.

14:13.188 --> 14:15.064
It's okay if you can't tell me yet.

14:15.440 --> 14:16.315
See ya.

14:17.442 --> 14:18.234
Wato-san!

14:29.454 --> 14:30.580
Oh, Rei-chan!

14:30.581 --> 14:31.622
Good morning, Rei-chan.

14:31.957 --> 14:34.417
You sounded great at rehearsal yesterday!

14:34.418 --> 14:35.751
You'll be there again today, won't you?

14:35.752 --> 14:37.336
I'll come hear you!

14:37.963 --> 14:38.838
Rei-chan?

14:38.839 --> 14:40.339
What's wrong, Rei-chan?

14:41.590 --> 14:43.623
There was a tennis match yesterday,

14:44.030 --> 14:48.157
and our seniors placed 3rd,

14:45.304 --> 14:47.555
Oh, it's not Rei-chan again.

14:47.556 --> 14:48.764
This sucks.

14:48.383 --> 14:51.170
juniors placed 5th,

14:49.224 --> 14:50.474
Yeah, yeah.

14:51.196 --> 14:55.250
and freshmen placed 4th.

14:58.734 --> 15:00.192
Hey, have you heard?

15:00.193 --> 15:02.904
Rei-chan is back in school, but acting strange.

15:02.905 --> 15:05.615
Yeah. She doesn't talk to anyone.

15:05.616 --> 15:07.533
She's not feeling well yet.

15:07.699 --> 15:10.244
But she was singing the other day.

15:16.585 --> 15:17.877
What's the matter?!

15:17.878 --> 15:18.506
Next!

15:19.046 --> 15:22.214
Asato-san is skipping rehearsal again today.

15:23.008 --> 15:24.926
What's up with her?

15:24.927 --> 15:28.930
Maybe she can't stand to sing with us since she's so good.

15:29.681 --> 15:30.973
That's annoying.

15:34.227 --> 15:35.102
Kumiko.

15:35.729 --> 15:36.938
Wato-san...

15:36.939 --> 15:39.982
Are you ready to tell me yet?

15:41.277 --> 15:42.151
I see...

15:42.152 --> 15:43.461
Asato-san hurt her voice...

15:43.737 --> 15:44.987
Now I see...

15:44.988 --> 15:47.031
I'm sorry I kept it a secret from you.

15:46.404 --> 15:47.764
Sign: Music Room

15:47.032 --> 15:47.865
No.

15:50.327 --> 15:55.289
She's working on chores like that after
school, after everyone else is gone.

15:56.833 --> 16:00.086
Polishing the instruments and
the floor, sorting the scores...

16:09.596 --> 16:12.257
Rei-chan loves to sing.

16:12.557 --> 16:14.600
She loves to use her voice.

16:14.773 --> 16:16.977
Please understand, Wato-san.

16:16.978 --> 16:17.561
Yeah.

16:21.653 --> 16:23.094
Oh, um...

16:28.657 --> 16:29.782
Rei-chan!

16:31.451 --> 16:32.368
Asato-san!

16:41.753 --> 16:44.672
Hey, baby, where are you going?

16:44.673 --> 16:45.714
We'll give you a ride.

16:45.715 --> 16:47.174
Let's go somewhere fun.

16:50.262 --> 16:52.346
It's not safe so late at night.

16:52.347 --> 16:54.807
Don't worry, we're kind.

16:55.267 --> 16:56.267
Hey, wait!

16:56.560 --> 16:58.060
Don't get so hasty!

16:58.061 --> 17:00.187
Huh? She can't talk.

17:00.188 --> 17:00.938
Really?!

17:02.107 --> 17:03.732
That's good.

17:06.111 --> 17:07.319
Who's there?!

17:12.617 --> 17:13.742
Who the hell are you?!

17:16.496 --> 17:17.705
Damn you!

17:17.706 --> 17:19.290
That's Rei's important score!

17:23.795 --> 17:24.837
What the hell?!

17:33.180 --> 17:35.222
What a tough guy...

17:36.016 --> 17:37.016
I'm not a guy!

17:37.017 --> 17:37.808
I'm a girl!

17:42.105 --> 17:44.504
Asato-san, it got dirty.

17:45.317 --> 17:47.610
I'm really useless.

17:54.815 --> 17:56.636
<i>That's not true.
I had the wrong impression of you.</i>

17:57.037 --> 18:03.000
But I always thought you were cocky, and annoying too.

18:03.001 --> 18:03.876
I'm sorry!

18:11.567 --> 18:13.634
<i>Thank you.</i>

18:14.095 --> 18:15.221
Rei-chan...

18:29.319 --> 18:31.153
It's a girl again!

18:34.449 --> 18:37.868
Doc's busy right now, so he won't see anyone.

18:37.869 --> 18:40.037
Largo, let's go for a walk!

18:42.666 --> 18:44.249
Doctor, please!

18:44.668 --> 18:46.032
Today is the day we promised!

18:46.294 --> 18:47.920
Please get Rei-chan's voice back!

18:48.380 --> 18:52.132
I only said I would consider the
operation if she kept her I promise.

18:52.467 --> 18:55.052
Rei-chan hasn't used her voice since then!

18:55.053 --> 18:55.886
So...

18:55.887 --> 18:58.170
Doctor, please cure Rei-chan.

18:58.473 --> 18:59.348
Please!

18:59.349 --> 19:00.265
<i>Wato-san!</i>

19:00.767 --> 19:02.810
I can work and pay for it, too.

19:03.395 --> 19:05.604
I beg you too, Doctor.

19:08.608 --> 19:10.943
I'm sorry, but this is just a tube.

19:12.696 --> 19:16.031
This being an artificial vocal chord is a lie.

19:18.618 --> 19:19.368
No way!

19:19.869 --> 19:20.828
Then what about Rei?!

19:20.829 --> 19:22.037
Will she ever...

19:23.456 --> 19:24.206
Rei?

19:32.799 --> 19:34.336
Rei-chan! Wait!

19:34.592 --> 19:37.511
<i>I will never again...</i>

19:40.557 --> 19:41.849
Going home already?

19:41.850 --> 19:44.727
Hey! It's dangerous over there!

20:20.096 --> 20:20.971
Rei-chan!

20:21.473 --> 20:23.302
Just in time!

20:23.558 --> 20:24.803
Miss Student President, your voice worked.

20:25.185 --> 20:27.155
Miss Student President, your voice worked.

20:29.105 --> 20:30.606
Doc!

20:30.607 --> 20:34.693
Come here! Hurry!

20:35.987 --> 20:37.961
My voice...

20:38.281 --> 20:39.490
lt's working!

20:39.866 --> 20:42.826
As long as your infection is gone, your voice will return.

20:42.827 --> 20:43.965
It's no mystery.

20:44.162 --> 20:49.041
But Doctor, you once told me that
I would never get my voice back!

20:49.042 --> 20:52.920
You wouldn't have taken me
seriously if I hadn't told you so.

20:54.130 --> 20:58.550
That day, you said that you'd rather
die than not have your voice.

20:59.052 --> 21:04.890
But sometimes, it's harder to conquer
an illness than to overcome death.

21:06.142 --> 21:06.767
Yes.

21:07.352 --> 21:10.812
You have two very good friends who
are very concerned about you.

21:11.439 --> 21:13.023
You should be happy to have them.

21:24.619 --> 21:25.772
Good morning, everyone.

21:25.954 --> 21:28.789
Let's have another fun, studious day.

21:28.998 --> 21:33.252
Also, there will be an indoor concert
by the choir in the gym after school.

21:33.544 --> 21:34.670
Please come see us!

21:34.671 --> 21:35.837
I'll see you there!

21:36.929 --> 21:37.976
Again!

21:41.970 --> 21:42.970
I just made it.

21:42.971 --> 21:45.264
By the way, kendo club captain, Wato-san,

21:45.556 --> 21:47.724
you were almost late again?

21:48.935 --> 21:53.230
Oh, it's also prohibited to eat your
breakfast while walking on campus.

21:56.192 --> 21:57.776
Jeez, Rei...

21:59.070 --> 22:00.153
Hey!

22:00.405 --> 22:02.572
Damn you, Rei!

22:07.078 --> 22:19.033
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.078 --> 22:19.033
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.151 --> 22:24.150
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.151 --> 22:24.150
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.719 --> 22:31.188
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.719 --> 22:31.188
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.732 --> 22:37.190
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.732 --> 22:37.190
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.794 --> 22:40.279
being heated up by you,

22:37.794 --> 22:40.279
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.488 --> 22:48.265
so much that I change color

22:40.488 --> 22:48.265
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.350 --> 23:00.119
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.350 --> 23:00.119
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.327 --> 23:12.058
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.327 --> 23:12.058
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.298 --> 23:23.649
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.298 --> 23:23.649
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.835 --> 23:28.756
I couldn't be happier

23:23.835 --> 23:28.756
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:28.984 --> 23:33.918
How does it taste?

23:28.984 --> 23:33.917
oaji wa ikaga?

23:45.091 --> 24:15.067
Mail Friends

23:45.218 --> 23:47.177
Hello CQ.

23:47.178 --> 23:50.139
I want to forget that I can't run at least while I'm chatting.

23:50.140 --> 23:53.183
I may be able to come to Japan.

23:53.184 --> 23:55.894
He'll find out that I've been lying all this time!

23:55.895 --> 23:57.104
Since when?

23:57.105 --> 23:58.063
Since he was four.

23:58.606 --> 24:00.858
All doctors are the same after all!

24:01.234 --> 24:03.527
Why are you so particular about baseball?

24:04.320 --> 24:05.487
This is my chance to see you!

24:05.780 --> 24:06.697
This is our farewell.

24:06.698 --> 24:07.547
Wait!

24:07.949 --> 24:10.022
There's something I want to talk about when I see you.

24:10.452 --> 24:11.496
I don't want to hear it!

24:12.120 --> 24:14.724
Next Karte - Mail Friends.

24:16.166 --> 24:17.764
Karte NG...

24:23.118 --> 24:23.691
Wato-san!

24:23.738 --> 24:24.738
Sorry!
